---
/**
 * pages/admin/contributors/import.astro
 *
 * Admin-only CSV bulk import for contributors. Imported contributors are name-only "inactive placeholders"
 * (no permissions conferred); extra CSV columns are ignored. Flow: upload → editable preview → server
 * dry-run → atomic commit.
 *
 * Copyright (C) 2026 Michael Wong.
 *
 * This file is part of the spot-kilmerviolin-website program, available at 
 * https://github.com/micawoken/spot-kilmerviolin-website.
